cstool changelog

1.1.1 (2026-11-08)
  - Fix pkg_resources dependency (deprecated), replaced with importlib, atexit and contextlib implementation

1.1.0 (2026-10-08)
  - Added min excitation to quantities written to .mat file
  - Separated phonon and Mott scattering mfps, costhetas etc, for use in a separated elastic scattering channel version of Nebula.
  - Added function documentation to several functions

1.0.7 (2024-08-21)
  - Update deprecated dependencies

1.0.6 (2022-02-05)
  - Fix URLs to NNDC

1.0.5 (2021-07-25)
  - Use correct lower bound for secondary electron excitation in semiconductors and insulators -- but properly this time

1.0.4 (2021-02-26)
  - Fix numerical issue with low momentum transfers in Penn model
  - Use correct lower bound for secondary electron excitation in semiconductors and insulators
  - Use .mat file extension instead of double .mat.hdf5.

1.0.3 (2021-02-25)
  - Fix error when low-energy optical data is lacking

1.0.2 (2020-08-04)
  - Compute and store elastic transport length
  - Compute and store stopping power for Penn model
  - Speedup ICDF calculation for the Penn model
  - Fix 'invalid value encountered in multiply' warning

1.0.1 (2020-07-14)
  - Fix VisibleDeprecationWarning introduced with numpy 1.19
  - Fix several compatibility issues with recent pint & old numpy versions

1.0.0 (2020-06-11)
  - Initial release
